  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic policy advice for Cuba&#x2019;s economic development.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to provide policy advice to Cuban economists and government organizations on economic reforms for development with these priorities fro the different Cuban counterparts: 

Ministry of Economy and Prices: tax reform and improvement of the tax collection; SME development; macroeconomic modeling for economic planning; foreign currency market.
The Cuban Central Bank: monetary regulation for inflation reduction
Cuban Center for Economic Studies: private sector measures for development</narrative>
  </description>
